<details><summary>maybe its because of my /etc/nginx/nginx.conf ???</summary>

```

user www-data;
worker_processes 4;
pid /var/run/nginx.pid;
events {
 worker_connections 128;
 # multi_accept on;
}
http {
 ##
 # Basic Settings
 ##
